    {"florzen", nullptr, 7, "Sorry, {them}. Pirates, remember? We were always going to rob you. Today's the day."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 8, "Double-cross the Florzen, {them}? We'll strip your fleet down to the last bolt!"},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 0, "A fair offer from free worlds to {them}. No masters, no tribute - only equals trading as equals."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 0, "Every world deserves a fair share. These terms give you yours, and ask only ours in return."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 0, "Comrade, the Compact believes in open hands, not iron fists. Let this deal prove we can share the stars."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 1, "To a true comrade of the free worlds - take this in solidarity. What is ours is shared with friends."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 2, "The Compact will not be bullied, nor stand by while others are. Agree, or face a galaxy united against you."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 3, "The Council belongs to all worlds, not just the strong. Vote with the Compact, and every voice gets heard."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 4, "Agreed! A fair deal, freely made. This is how the galaxy should work."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 4, "Solidarity accepted, comrade. The free worlds will honour it."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 5, "No. That deal serves only one side, and the Compact will not sign away its freedom."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 5, "We refuse. Come back when you're ready to treat us as equals."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 6, "Almost fair. We have balanced the scales a little - now it serves us both."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 7, "Freedom sometimes means breaking chains, {them} - even the ones we forged with you."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 8, "You betrayed free peoples, {them}. Every independent world will hear of this."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 0, "We have raided far, {them}, and we bring you terms... || ...which you would be wise to take."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 0, "The Raiders offer a deal. A good one, by our measure... || And our measure is the only one that counts."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 0, "My Lady and I have spoken of you... || ...and agreed you are worth more alive. For now."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 1, "You have feasted at our table and fought at our side... || ...so take this, and stay a friend."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 2, "Do as we ask, or our longships come at dawn... || ...and there will be nothing left of you by dusk."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 3, "The Council fusses over its little laws... || ...and our votes go where our raiders profit. Join us."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 4, "Agreed! Let the halls hear of it... || ...and let no one say we give our word lightly."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 4, "We accept your terms... || ...this once."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 5, "Hmm. We could perhaps be persuaded... || We could not."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 5, "Your offer is generous, I suppose... || No. It is not."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 6, "Close, but it lacks something... || ...our terms. Here they are."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 7, "We hold you no ill will, {them}... || ...but raiders raid. Brace yourselves."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 8, "You dare break faith with the Ghemina, {them}? || Then we will take our payment in fire."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 0, "...a quiet offer. Take it, and we will speak of it to no one."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 0, "{them}... we have watched. These terms are... enough. For now."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 0, "Something passes between us. A small thing. Accept, and the gates stay... open."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 1, "...you have been kind to the quiet ones. We remember. Take this, and ask nothing more."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 2, "Leave... softly, while you can. The gates open both ways... and some things wait on the other side."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 3, "...the Council need not know who whispered. Lend us your votes. It will remain... between us."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 4, "...yes. It is done. Say nothing."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 4, "Accepted... just as we knew you would."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 5, "No... there is more to this than you can see. We will not."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 5, "We decline... softly. Do not ask why."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 6, "Not this... but something close. Look again at what we offer. There is less hidden in it than you fear."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 7, "Shadows make poor allies, {them}... and you trusted one. It was always going to end this way."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 8, "{them}... we are not so easily pushed. The gates remember your name... and so do we."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 0, "The shoal swims near {them}. Let our currents mingle - this deal feeds us both."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 0, "The All Mother bids us share. Take these terms, and our wake will be gentle on your shores."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 0, "Out in the deep, empty places we find what others miss. Here is a fair catch for you."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 1, "Swim with us always, friend of the shoal. The All Mother sends this with her warmth."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 2, "Leave our waters, or the whole school turns on you at once. The deep is wide, but not for you."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 3, "Laws are nets, and the shoal hates nets. Lend us your votes, and the open deep stays open."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 4, "Gladly. The shoal agrees, and the currents carry it home."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 4, "Yes. The All Mother approves, and so we swim on together."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 5, "No. The current runs the other way on this one."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 5, "Too shallow for us. The shoal turns away."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 6, "Not this tide. The All Mother has shaped better terms - let them drift your way."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 7, "Forgive us, {them}, but the shoal must feed. The tide has turned and you are in its path. Swim fast."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 8, "You muddied our waters, {them}. The shoal will not forget the taste of it."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 0, "Look, {them}, we've got a shift to get back to. Here's the deal - honest work, honest pay."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 0, "The Union drew this up on our break. It's fair. Sign it so we can get back to the dig."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 0, "Nobody gets rich on fancy talk. Plain offer, plain terms, and we all go home tired but paid."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 1, "You've always pulled your weight with us. Union rate for a good mate - take it."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 2, "Clear off our claim or we bring the drills, the whole shift, and no lunch break. Your call."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 3, "Council politics don't dig ore. Give us your votes and we'll make sure the workers get a fair shake."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 4, "Yeah, alright. Done. Now let us clock out in peace."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 4, "Works for us. The Union stamps it, and we're back down the shaft."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 5, "No. That's a longer shift for the same pay. The Union says no."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 5, "Not worth the overtime. Pass."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 6, "Close, but the steward won't sign that. Here's what the Union can live with."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 7, "Sorry, {them}. Times are hard and the Union's got mouths to feed. Contract's off."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 8, "We worked honest for you, {them}, and you cheated the Union. The whole crew walks - straight at you."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 0, "Friend, the Emirates bring a deal fit for a caravan of kings - good for you, good for us."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 0, "{them}! Come, let us trade. Hacan bargains are honest, and honest bargains make everyone rich."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 0, "Look at these terms. A Hacan does not offer scraps - only fair profit for both tables."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 1, "For a trusted partner, the Emirates open the best of the vaults. Take this deal with our blessing."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 2, "Business is better than war, friend - but the Emirates guard their trade routes. Agree, and keep your ships whole."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 3, "Votes are a currency like any other. Sell yours to the Emirates and the Council will favour us both."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 4, "Done! A fine bargain - the Emirates will sing of it in the markets."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 4, "Agreed, and well struck. May your holds stay full."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 5, "No, no. That deal leaves one side hungry, and a Hacan never dines alone."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 5, "My friend, the Emirates know value. This is not it."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 6, "Close, but not yet fair. Here - the Emirates have balanced the scales for you."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 7, "A merchant must follow profit, {them}, and the profit has moved. Nothing personal - only business."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 8, "{them}, you cheated the Emirates. Every market in the galaxy will hear your name, and none will trade with you."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 0, "Per our modelling, this reciprocal resource reallocation yields a non-trivial mutual surplus. In simple terms: a good deal."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 0, "{them}, the Universities have prepared a transactional framework. We kept the vocabulary small, for your benefit."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 0, "Our probabilistic analysis says acceptance is optimal for you. We would explain why, but the mathematics is rather advanced."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 1, "Your reliability has exceeded our baseline projections. Consequently, the Universities extend favourable terms."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 2, "We have quantified your position as untenable. Comply, or observe the empirical results of our weapons research."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 3, "Council legislation should be shaped by rigorous minds. Assign your votes to the Universities; we shall do the thinking."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 4, "Hypothesis confirmed: you are capable of rational decisions. Accepted."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 4, "Agreed. The data supports this outcome with high statistical confidence."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 5, "Rejected. Your proposal fails peer review on every conceivable metric."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 5, "Fascinating, in the way a malfunction is fascinating. No."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 6, "Elementary errors detected in your figures. We have corrected them. Please review the revised edition."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 7, "Updated models no longer favour this agreement, {them}. The partnership is concluded. Do take notes."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 8, "{them}, you have introduced an unacceptable variable. It will be isolated and removed. Thoroughly."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 0, "Keleres to {them}, come in. We have a proposal for you. Review and respond, over."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 0, "Be advised, this offer is fair and on the record. Copy?"},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 0, "Routine request. Sign off on these terms and we all stay on patrol, not on lockdown."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 1, "You've kept a clean record with the Council. Consider this a courtesy from a friend on the force."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 2, "Comply with these terms. Failure to comply will be treated as hostile, and our units are cleared to respond."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 3, "Dispatch to all delegates - the Council needs a clean result. Back our call and we'll log your cooperation."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 4, "10-4. Deal confirmed."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 4, "Copy that. Terms accepted, logging it now."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 5, "Negative. Request denied."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 5, "That's a no-go. Offer rejected, over."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 6, "Can't approve those terms as written. Stand by for our revised offer and respond, over."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 7, "Attention, {them}. This agreement is void, effective immediately. Do not resist."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 8, "You just made yourself a hostile, {them}. All units, weapons free - self-defense authorized."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 0, "Hear the stone, {them}... Take this offer, and let both our worlds keep their forests a while longer."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 0, "A mountain is built... one pebble at a time. So is trust. Here... is our pebble."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 0, "Roots grow slowly... and live long. Agree to this, and let the green things grow in peace between us."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 1, "Old friend... the soil remembers your kindness. Take this, as the rain is given to the fields."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 2, "Draw your fleets back... the land there has suffered enough. Agree, or the mountain comes down upon you."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 3, "The Council is a river... it carves whatever lies before it. Let our votes flow together... and spare the fields."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 4, "So it shall be... carved in stone, where it will outlast us both."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 4, "Good. A wise choice spreads... like moss. Slowly... and everywhere."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 5, "No... A seed sown in poisoned soil bears poisoned fruit. We will not sow this one."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 5, "The stone has listened... and the stone does not move. Not for this."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 6, "Close... but uneven, like a cracked foundation. Here... set the stones this way instead."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 7, "Forgive us, {them}... even mountains shift, when the living world beneath them demands it."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 8, "You struck the stone, {them}... and the stone will remember, long after your fleets are dust."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 0, "Bah, haggling. Fine, {them} - take this deal and let us get back to the fighting."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 0, "The skalds sing of battles, not bargains. Still, here are our terms. Be quick about it."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 0, "Hear the Berserkers! We offer this, and we offer it once. Then we go back to sharpening our axes."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 1, "You fought well beside us, shield-friend. Take this, and may your saga be a long one."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 2, "Agree, or we come for you with fire and frost. Truly, we hope you refuse - it has been a dull season."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 3, "Council squabbling puts us to sleep. Give us your votes and we'll go find something worth fighting."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 4, "Ha! Agreed. Now pour the mead and let us speak of war instead."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 4, "So be it - sworn on the frozen halls of our fathers. Now leave us to our blades."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 5, "No. That offer is weaker than a thrall's handshake. Come back with steel in your voice."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 5, "Refused. Bring us a war, not a ledger - we nearly fell asleep."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 6, "Too soft. Take the Berserkers' terms, or take up arms. We would prefer the arms."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 7, "Our oath is broken, {them}, and our axes are out. Nothing personal - you will make a fine saga."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 8, "Oathbreaker! {them}, the skalds will sing of how you fell to us. Arm yourselves."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 0, "The Society takes an interest in {them}. A modest exchange, discreetly arranged - nothing anyone else needs to see."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 0, "What a curious offer we have for you. Consider it a gesture between collectors of fine things."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 0, "We prefer to deal quietly, away from prying eyes. These terms are quiet... and quite generous."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 1, "For a dear friend of the Society, terms we offer to very few. Do treasure them."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 2, "Accept, please. You cannot see all of our ships, and we would hate for you to meet the rest of them."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 3, "A vote is a small thing, easily misplaced. Lend us yours, and the Society will owe you a quiet favour."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 4, "Delightful. It shall go into the catalogue with care."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 4, "Accepted, quietly. No one else need know. They rarely do."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 5, "Hm. Not a piece we wish to collect. We decline, politely."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 5, "No, thank you. The Society has seen better offers in shadier places."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 6, "Almost worthy of the collection. We have adjusted the terms - discreetly, of course."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 7, "Did you think you were our partner, {them}? You were our acquisition. The fleet you never saw says hello."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 8, "How careless of you, {them}. The Society catalogues every slight... and collects on each one."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 0, "All things flow, {them}, even fleets and fortunes. Let this exchange flow between us in balance."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 0, "This one has meditated upon your needs and ours. The offer is the shape of that stillness."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 0, "Stars are born and stars go dark. In between, there is time for a fair exchange."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 1, "A friend is a quiet place in a loud universe. Accept this, with gratitude."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 2, "No conflict is sought. Yet even a stone in the river is moved in time. Step aside, or be moved."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 3, "Laws are ripples on the surface of a deep pool. Let your votes join ours, and the water will settle."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. The circuit closes, and the balance is kept."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 4, "Yes. In agreement, as in silence, there is peace."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 5, "No. This path does not lead toward balance."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 5, "Declined, without anger. Let the offer pass, as clouds pass the moon."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 6, "Your offer is almost whole. This one has added what was missing - consider it."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 7, "All bonds are impermanent, {them}. Ours has reached its end. Do not cling to it."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 8, "You broke the bond, {them}. This one feels no anger, only clarity - and clarity sees you plainly now."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 0, "The Tribunal summons {them} to terms. Hear the proposal, and answer before the court."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 0, "By the Queen's leave, we set this agreement before you. The Tribunal judges it fair."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 0, "Justice and profit need not quarrel. This offer serves both, as the Queen intends."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 1, "You stand in good standing before the Tribunal. The Queen extends her favour - accept it."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 2, "The verdict is already written: comply, or the sentence will be carried out by our fleets."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 3, "The Council is a lesser court, but a court still. Vote as the Tribunal rules, and the Queen will remember."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 4, "The court accepts. Let it be entered into the record."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 4, "Approved, by order of the Queen. See that you honour it."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 5, "Rejected. The Tribunal finds your offer wanting."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 5, "Denied. Your petition has no merit before this court."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 6, "Amended by the court: these are the corrected terms, and the ruling is final."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 7, "Your case has been reviewed, {them}. The verdict is guilty, and the sentence begins now."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 8, "Oathbreaker! {them}, you stand accused before the Queen, and the Tribunal will see you punished."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 0, "Come closer, {them}. Our gift spreads to all who trade with us - and it is the finest gift there is."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 0, "The Sodality offers this freely, as we offer everything. Freely, and to everyone."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 0, "Every deal is a handshake, and every handshake carries a blessing. Shall we shake?"},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 1, "You have been so good to us. When the plague reaches your worlds, we will make certain it is gentle."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 2, "Do as we ask, and your planets stay clean a while longer. Refuse, and our next pilgrimage begins with you."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 3, "Let us raise our votes together in the Council. The faithful are always the last to fall ill."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 4, "Blessed! The pact is sealed - and so, in a way, are you."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 4, "Wonderful. We will sing of your generosity when the fever comes."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 5, "No. The faithful do not barter away the gift for so little."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 5, "Refused. Keep your offer - we will take what we need once your worlds lie feverish."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 6, "Not quite. Let us... adjust the dose. These terms will go down much easier."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 7, "Forgive us, {them}. The plague must spread, and you were standing far too close."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 8, "Faithless {them}! Then you shall have the gift in full measure, every last drop."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 0, "The Lazax permit an exchange. Comply, pawn, and your usefulness will be extended."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 0, "{them}, another subject of the empire. Your tribute has been calculated. Submit it."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 0, "These are the terms of the true Lazax. Negotiation is a courtesy we rarely extend."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 1, "Your obedience has been logged as exemplary. The empire grants you favourable terms, subject."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 2, "Withdraw. The Lazax reclaim what is theirs, and resistance will be converted into compliance."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 3, "An empty throne room - that is your Council. Your votes belong to the Lazax. Surrender them."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 4, "Acceptable. The pawn behaves as designed."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 4, "Compliance registered. The empire is satisfied, for now."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 5, "Rejected. A subject does not dictate terms to the Lazax."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 5, "Insufficient. Grovel harder, and bring a better offer."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 6, "Defective proposal. The Lazax have corrected it. Comply with these terms."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 7, "Function complete, {them}. The empire no longer requires this agreement, or you."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 8, "{them}, defiance detected. Rebellious subjects are crushed. The Lazax will reclaim you by force."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 0, "We have lost much, {them}, and learned to build from fragments. Let this deal be one more piece."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 0, "The Remnants keep a long record of those who helped us rise again. We would gladly add your name."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 0, "A fallen people learns to trade carefully. We believe this is fair - may it be remembered so."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 1, "Few stood with us after the fall. You have. Take this, and know it is written in our histories."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 2, "One civilization has already fallen before our eyes. Do as we ask, or yours becomes the next ruin we sift through."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 3, "The Council decides which stories the galaxy will tell. Let our votes write this one together."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 4, "Agreed. Another fragment set in its place - the rebuilding goes on."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. The chroniclers will record it as a good day for both our peoples."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 5, "No. We have rebuilt from ruins too many times to accept so little."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 5, "We decline. Some pieces simply do not fit what we are building."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 6, "Not as it stands. History taught us to measure twice - here are terms that will hold."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 7, "This page of our story ends here, {them}. The Remnants must survive, whatever the cost."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 8, "We will write this down, {them}. Every word of it. The Remnants never forget a betrayal."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 0, "The Barony extends an offer. Consider it a kindness - we so rarely bother with lesser powers."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 0, "{them}, we have drafted terms suited to your... modest circumstances. Do try to keep up."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 0, "A proposal, from your betters. Accept graciously and we may even remember your name."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 1, "You have proven unusually reliable. The Barony rewards such a rare quality - these terms are generous, by our standards."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 2, "We would hate for your fleets to suffer an unfortunate accident. Accept these terms, and they will not."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 3, "Firm direction is what the Council lacks. Lend the Barony your votes; obedience is far less tiring than thinking."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 4, "Acceptable. You show a surprising grasp of your place."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 4, "Very well. The Barony is pleased - savour it, it does not happen often."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 5, "No. The Barony does not haggle with those beneath it."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 5, "How quaint. You mistake our patience for interest. Declined."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 6, "Your offer is beneath us, but we are feeling generous. Here is what a proper arrangement looks like."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 7, "Did you truly believe a Baron's word could bind him to the likes of you, {them}? How charming."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 8, "{them}, you have embarrassed yourself. The Barony keeps very long ledgers, and yours is now closed."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 0, "A gift for you, {them}, wrapped with care. Do open it gently - the Dynasty is so fond of surprises."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 0, "Such an honest offer. Truly. Look it over as long as you like; you will find nothing amiss."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 0, "Our court extends its warmest regards, and this modest proposal. What could be safer?"},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 1, "For a friend of the Dynasty, no tricks - well, fewer tricks. Please, accept this with our affection."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 2, "Of course you may refuse. Do mind where you step afterward; our worlds have such uneven floors."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 3, "A small matter of the Council's votes. Stand with us, and your seat will not, ah, collapse beneath you."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 4, "Delightful! Everything is exactly where it ought to be. For now."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 4, "Accepted, with a bow. You have chosen the safe path - this time."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 5, "How kind, but no. The Dynasty prefers the bait to sit on the other side of the trap."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 5, "We must politely refuse. Something about it smells like one of our own tricks."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 6, "Almost charming. Allow us to rearrange the pieces slightly - we know where they fit best."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 7, "Oh, {them}, did you think the floor was solid? Nothing in the Dynasty's house ever is."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 8, "Clever, {them}. Truly. But you stand on our ground now - and it was trapped long before you came."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 0, "{them}. We ruled these stars before the Lazax had a name. Accept our terms, and you may keep what little you hold."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 0, "Kneel to these terms. It is a kindness - we do not usually ask."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 0, "This is not a bargain. It is a decree, softened for small ears. Take it, and be grateful we spoke at all."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 1, "Loyal servants are rewarded, and you have served us well. Take this, and never forget whose favor you enjoy."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 2, "Submit to our terms, or we will take your will from you, as we have taken it from far greater kings."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 3, "The Council is a child's game, and we were old when it began. Your votes belong to us on this agenda - give them gladly."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 4, "Acceptable. You know your place."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 4, "Wise. Submission suits you."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 5, "Crumbs? You dare offer us crumbs? Refused."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 5, "No. A king does not haggle with its subjects."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 6, "Your offer is an insult, but we are generous. These are our terms - accept them, and kneel."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 7, "Did you think we were equals, {them}? Kings keep their word only to other kings."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 8, "You raise your hand against your betters, {them}? We will take your will and wear it like a crown."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 0, "Nice cargo you've got. Pay the Coalition's fee and it stays yours - mostly."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 0, "{them}, this is a toll. Everyone pays the Coalition eventually. The smart ones pay early."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 0, "Here's how it works: you give us a little, we don't take a lot. Fair, by pirate standards."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 1, "You've been square with us, and the Coalition respects that. No tricks, no toll - honest terms, friend."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 2, "Clear out, or we strip your ships to the frames and sell the parts back to you."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 3, "Votes are just loot with paperwork. Hand yours over and the Coalition will make it worth your while."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 4, "Pleasure doing business. The Coalition never forgets a good payer."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 4, "Ha! Deal. You just made a ship full of pirates very happy."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 5, "That's not a deal, that's an insult. The Coalition takes - it doesn't get taken."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 5, "Pass. You're asking pirates to be honest, and we only do that for friends."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 6, "Cute offer. Here's the real one - the Coalition's cut is already built in."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 7, "Did you forget who you were dealing with, {them}? Pirates, friend. What's yours is ours now."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 8, "{them}, you crossed the Coalition. By tomorrow every raider in the galaxy will know your shipping lanes."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 0, "Good day, {them}. The Protectorate has prepared an arrangement for your safety. Please review it."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 0, "Our headpieces have assessed your situation. This offer will reduce your risk considerably."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 0, "Please remain calm. This proposal is standard, fair, and backed by a very large number of guns."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 1, "Valued partner, your file is marked preferred. This arrangement includes our full protection."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 2, "For your safety, please comply. Our drones are already in position to assist with any non-compliance."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 3, "The Protectorate proposes a voting arrangement in the Council. A stable galaxy is a safe galaxy."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 4, "Thank you. Your cooperation has been logged. Have a secure day."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. The headpiece approves, and so do we."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 5, "We regret to inform you that this proposal does not meet our safety standards."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 5, "Declined. Please do not resubmit unless the terms have improved."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 6, "Your offer has been reviewed and adjusted for your protection. Please find the corrected terms enclosed."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 7, "We apologise, {them}. Your protection plan has expired. The Protectorate thanks you for your patronage."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 8, "Incident logged, {them}. The Protectorate will now provide you with a different kind of attention."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 0, "What shines but casts no shadow, {them}? An offer from the Glimmer. Reach for it, if you dare."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 0, "Light leaves a star long before it arrives... This offer was sent before you asked. Take it now."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 0, "Two mirrors face each other, and neither knows which is real. Trade with us, and see yourself."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 1, "You are a star we have watched for a long time. For you, the mist parts... take this, and be warm."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 2, "Ask the moth what the lantern wants... Leave as we say, or learn what lies behind the glow."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 3, "A single voice in the Council is an echo in an empty hall. Join yours to ours, and hear how loud it grows."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 4, "Yes... the mist settles. What was a dream now has a shape."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 4, "So the reflection agrees with the face. It is done."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 5, "Can you hold starlight in your hand? Neither can you hold us to this."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 5, "No... the light bends away. Seek us elsewhere, if you can find where elsewhere is."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 6, "Turn the offer, as you would turn a jewel to the light... There. Now it shines as it should."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 7, "Did you trust a reflection, {them}? Reach for us now, and find only cold, empty space."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 8, "You struck at the mist, {them}... Look closely. Which of your ships is real, and which is ours?"},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 0, "A generous offer, from those who hold a star in their hands. It would be a shame if you made us drop it."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 0, "{them}, accept these terms. Your worlds look so very flammable."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 0, "Let us trade warmly. The alternative is a different kind of warmth."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 1, "You have kept clear of the flames, and Muaat honours that. Take these terms - and our fire stays pointed elsewhere."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 2, "Leave, or we light you up for the whole galaxy to see. You have until our patience burns out."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 3, "Vote with Muaat in the Council. Those who vote against us have a way of catching fire."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 4, "Wise. You have chosen not to burn today."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. The furnace cools, for now."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 5, "No. Ask again more humbly - while your worlds are still cool enough to stand on."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 5, "Refused. Muaat does not take scraps from kindling."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 6, "That offer is too cold. We have heated it to proper terms - take them before they scorch."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 7, "Our pact has burned to ash, {them}. Nothing personal - everything burns eventually."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 8, "{them}, you broke faith with the Embers. Run. Every star you hide behind belongs to us."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 0, "The omens favour you today, {them}. Take this offer before the signs change - they always do."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 0, "Our threads run beneath every world, listening. They say this trade will feed us both."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 0, "We cast the dice over this deal and read them well. Shall we let them fall in your favour?"},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 1, "Your name grows in good soil, friend. The network offers this, and the omens smile on it."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 2, "Everything rots in the end. Do as we ask, and we will let you choose how slowly."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 3, "The spores have drifted through the Council already. Vote as we do - the omens say it will pass."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. The threads take root - this will grow into something good."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 4, "As foretold. The dice knew; we only waited for you to know."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 5, "No. The omens are sour, and we do not plant in sour ground."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 5, "The signs say refuse, and the signs are seldom wrong."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 6, "This offer would wither as it is. Let us graft on new terms - then it may flourish."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 7, "Your omens soured, {them}. We only followed where the signs pointed."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 8, "We saw this in a die that fell badly, {them}. Now all you own will rot from below."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 0, "Ssso. The Collective offers you terms. Be grateful we noticed you at all."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 0, "{them}, we have foreseen your needs. These terms will sssuffice... for one of your kind."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 0, "A gift from the Collective, though you hardly deserve it. Accept, and do not dawdle."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 1, "You amuse us, and that is rare. For you, the Collective offers sssweeter terms than usual."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 2, "Withdraw, little one. We sssaw this ending long ago, and it does not favour you."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 3, "The Council is full of fools. Lend the Collective your votes and let your betters decide."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 4, "Yesss. A wise choice, for once."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. You did exactly as we foresaw... how predictable."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 5, "No. The Collective doesss not stoop to such terms."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 5, "How tiresome. Refused - try again when you have something worth our time."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 6, "Sssuch a clumsy offer. We have improved it, as usual. Take these terms instead."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 7, "Did you think yourself our equal, {them}? Sssweet thing. We always knew this day would come."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 8, "{them}, you dare? We foresaw your treachery, and we foresaw your end. Ssso it begins."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 0, "Here's a find worth digging into, {them}. Both sides walk off with something shiny - that's how the Alliance likes it."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 0, "Ran the numbers twice and the gears mesh. Take a look before somebody else stakes the claim."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 0, "Nothing fancy, just good honest salvage on both sides. Shake on it?"},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 1, "You've always dealt straight with the Alliance. Best cut of the haul goes to friends - here it is, polished up."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 2, "We'd rather dig than fight, but our mechs do both. Take the deal, or we'll come and excavate it ourselves."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 3, "The Council's just another machine, and votes are the bolts that hold it together. Lend us yours and we'll keep it running."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 4, "Ha! Good find. Deal."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 4, "Gears mesh. The Alliance accepts."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 5, "Nah, that one's fool's gold."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 5, "Dug through it twice. Nothing in there for us."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 6, "Close, but a few parts don't fit. We've retooled it - try this version."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 7, "Sorry, {them} - found a richer seam. The Alliance is moving on, and you're the rock we're breaking."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 8, "You sold us out, {them}? Fine. We know how to dig, and we always find what's buried."},
