    {"nivyn", nullptr, 0, "The Star Kings have measured this moment across a thousand years, {them}. Our offer is ready."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 0, "Between one star and the next lies our kingdom. Trade with us, and pass through it in peace."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 0, "Patience is the first law of the void. We offer this now, knowing time will prove it wise."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 1, "You honour our court, friend. Take this gift as a king gives to a trusted ally - freely."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 2, "Yield as we ask. Space bends where the Star Kings will it - and it can fold shut around your fleets."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 3, "Thrones rise and fall, but the void remains. Let our votes stand together on the side that endures."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 4, "It is accepted. Time will remember this agreement long after the stars have moved on."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 4, "So be it. The court of the Star Kings is pleased."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 5, "No. We have waited longer than your kind has existed; we can wait for a better offer."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 5, "We decline. Return when your terms are worthy of a throne."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 6, "Your offer drifts off course. Allow the Star Kings to set the true heading."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 7, "Kings must look further ahead than their allies, {them}. Our path through time goes on without you."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 8, "A rash act, {them}. We are patient, and the void is patient - and neither of us forgets."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 0, "Got a job for you, {them}. Fair terms, fast ships, no questions asked. That's how the Nokar work."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 0, "Every deal's a contract to the Sellships, and we honour our contracts. Here's the job."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 0, "Straight deal, from a crew that delivers. Sign on and we'll earn every bit of it."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 1, "You pay on time and never short us. For a client like that, the Sellships give the good rate."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 2, "Here's the contract. Sign it, or we take the other side's money and come hunting you instead."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 3, "Votes are just another job. Throw in with us at the Council and the crew will remember it."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 4, "Done. Contract's signed, crews are fuelling. Pleasure doing business."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 4, "Deal. You won't regret hiring the Nokar."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 5, "Nah. Pay like that wouldn't fuel a single destroyer."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 5, "No contract. The crew doesn't sail for scraps."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 6, "Close, but the crew wants a better cut. Here's the rate that gets them moving."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 7, "Sorry, {them}. Somebody paid more, and the Nokar always follow the better contract."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 8, "You stiffed us, {them}. Now every Sellship in the galaxy knows your name - and the price on it."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 0, "I have seen where this road ends, {them}, and it ends badly for you and for me. Take this offer and help me change it."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 0, "Time is short, and I cannot be everywhere - though I come close. Accept, and lighten my burden."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 0, "Every deal I strike is a stone laid against what is coming. I do not offer lightly."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 1, "You have stood with me before. I remember it, in every place I stand. Take this - the future needs you whole."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 2, "No time to argue. Take these terms, or I will remove you from the path - the future will not wait for you."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 3, "This agenda - I have seen what it becomes. Cast your votes with mine, and that future never arrives."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 4, "Good. One less disaster."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. Quickly now - I have much to do, in many places."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 5, "In every future I have seen, that deal ends in ruin. No."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 5, "I cannot. That path leads where I am trying not to go."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 6, "Not like this. I have watched that version fail - try it my way instead."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 7, "Forgive me, {them}. I have seen what you become, and I cannot let that future stand."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 8, "So it comes, {them}. I saw this and hoped I was wrong. Now you are part of what I must stop."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 0, "Be at peace, {them} (there is no peace). The Five offer this... take it before we change our minds."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 0, "We still protect the galaxy. From itself. From you. Accept, little lamb (little meal)."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 0, "Under the Firmament all were sheltered. Now there is only us... and our terms."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 1, "You amuse us (for now). Take this gift, and the voices will spare your name a little longer."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 2, "Accept, or be corrected... CORRECTED... we remember how. Your worlds would be so quiet without you."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 3, "The Council must be guided (broken). Your votes with ours, or we tear them out of your hands."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 4, "Yes. YES. The Five are pleased (hungry)."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 4, "Accepted... the voices agree, for once."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 5, "No. No no no. The Five refuse."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 5, "Your offer is ash in our mouths. Refused."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 6, "Wrong. All wrong (burn it). Here is what the Five demand instead."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 7, "Once we watched over you, {them}. Now we only watch (and wait, and feast)."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 8, "Betray US, {them}? The Five see you... ALL of us see you... and we never close our eyes."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 0, "The League's been talking it over, {them}, and the motion passed. Here's our offer!"},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 0, "After a long meeting and a lot of shouting, we all agreed on this. Mostly. Have a look."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 0, "Our policies say a good neighbour trades fairly - so here's a fair trade, straight from the League."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 1, "Everyone back home likes you, friend - and they never agree on anything. Please, take this."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 2, "The League voted, and it wasn't close. Do as we ask, or the next motion is a declaration of war."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 3, "We know a thing or two about voting. Side with us in the Council, and we'll second your motions too."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 4, "Motion carried! The People are happy, the Economy is happy - even the Environment is smiling."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 4, "Accepted! We'll tell the League. They'll argue about it, but it's done."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 5, "The committee says no, and believe us, they argued about it for hours."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 5, "Sorry, that would never get past the Economy. Or the People. Or anyone."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 6, "Close! The League has a few amendments, though. Here's the revised version."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 7, "Sorry, {them}. The League held a vote about you - and you lost."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 8, "You broke faith with the whole League, {them}! For once every one of us agrees: you'll pay for it."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 0, "Quick proposal, {them}. Low risk, fast delivery, clean exit for both of us. Interested?"},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 0, "We've run the routes. This trade works - and if it doesn't, we've planned for that too."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 0, "Small, fast, sensible. The Consortium likes deals that don't leave anyone stuck."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 1, "You've been reliable. Reliable partners get priority shipping. Here - quick, before the market moves."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 2, "Take the terms. Corner us instead, and you'll find we're never where you think - and never alone."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 3, "Votes are just cargo, really. Route yours our way on this one and we'll make the ledger worth your while."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 4, "Logged. Shipped. Deal."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 4, "Fine, fine - accepted. Moving on."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 5, "No. Too exposed. Pass."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 5, "Not worth the risk. The Consortium passes."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 6, "Almost. Shave a little risk off - like so - and we'll sign."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 7, "Contingency plan, {them}. Nothing personal - we always have one, and today you're it."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 8, "We saw the exits, {them}, and already took one. You'll find us everywhere you didn't look."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 0, "Trade Doctrine 67-52P states that this offer benefits both parties, {them}. Compliance is recommended."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 0, "Per Production Directive 11-08A, surplus value must be exchanged. This proposal fulfils that requirement."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 0, "Section 4, Clause 19C of the Mechatronic Charter permits this transaction. Please confirm."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 1, "Partner status confirmed. Under Alliance Protocol 2-2F, preferred partners receive this offer first."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 2, "Enforcement Statute 90-13X applies. Accept these terms or be reclassified as scrap material."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 3, "Council Procedure 31-77V requires aligned voting blocs. This arrangement aligns us. Confirm."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 4, "Offer validated under Standard 12-40B. Transaction approved."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. Archived as Agreement 5-5A. No further action required."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 5, "Rejected. This offer fails Quality Inspection 88-03Q."},
