    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 6, "Non-compliant offer. The attached Revision 3 corrects all errors per Amendment 67-53P."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 7, "Notice, {them}: Termination Clause 00-01Z is now in effect. Your agreement is void."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 8, "Breach recorded, {them}. Retaliation Protocol 70-11R is active. War sun production has begun."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 0, "We are only passing through. A small exchange, and we go our separate ways in peace."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 0, "{them}, the Clan has little, but we share what we can. Will you trade with wanderers?"},
    {"saar", nullptr, 0, "Our ships are our homes, and homes need supplies. A fair trade, nothing more."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 1, "You have treated the Clan kindly. Here - take this deal, from one friend of the road to another."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 2, "Please, give us room to move. We do not want a fight, but we have been chased before, and we learned to bite."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 3, "The Council's laws rarely help those who wander. Vote with us, and perhaps this one will."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 4, "Thank you. The Clan will remember this kindness on the long roads."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 4, "Good. That is fair, and fair is all we ever ask."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 5, "Sadly, we cannot. It would tie us down, and we do not stay tied."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 5, "Forgive us, but no. The Clan has learned to be careful with promises."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 6, "Not quite like that. Here is a gentler way, one that lets us both keep moving."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 7, "This promise cannot come with us, {them}. The Clan must move on, and we are sorry."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 8, "{them}, we trusted you, and you broke it. We will move on, as we always do - but the Clan never forgets a broken road."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 0, "KRRAAK! N'orr want trade. You give, N'orr give. Simple. Good."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 0, "{them}! N'orr bring deal. Take it. N'orr not like waiting!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 0, "Skreee... deal for you. Strong deal. N'orr only make strong things."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 1, "You fight good. N'orr respect you. Good deal for strong friend - take!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 2, "Leave! This N'orr place now! Stay, and N'orr crack your ships like shells. SKREEE!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 3, "Council talk-talk, too much talk. Give N'orr your votes. N'orr end talking."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 4, "Good! Deal done. N'orr happy."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 4, "Yes. Yes! Strong trade. N'orr remember."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 5, "NO! Weak deal. N'orr spit on weak deal!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 5, "Hssss... no. N'orr not fools. Bring better."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 6, "Bad deal. N'orr fix. This one better - take, take!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 7, "Deal over, {them}! N'orr hungry for war now. SKREEEE!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 8, "{them} lie to N'orr?! KRAAAK! N'orr come. N'orr break everything!"},
    {"sol", nullptr, 0, "The Federation believes in mutually beneficial agreements. We think you'll find these terms very reasonable."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 0, "{them}, let's keep things civil. Here's our proposal - we'd encourage you to take it seriously."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 0, "On behalf of the Federation: a fair arrangement, offered in good faith. Good faith is something we value."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 1, "You've been a good friend to the Federation, and we look after our friends. These terms reflect that."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 2, "Diplomacy is what the Federation prefers. We also have the largest fleets you will ever see. Accept, and we stay diplomatic."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 3, "In the Council, stability matters. Vote with the Federation, and you'll find us grateful partners."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 4, "Excellent. The Federation is glad we could reach an understanding."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 4, "Agreed. This is how responsible powers do business."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 5, "We appreciate the offer, but the Federation can't support it. Our position stands."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 5, "Respectfully, no. And we'd recommend you don't mistake our patience for weakness."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 6, "That can't be signed as written. Our people have prepared a revised draft - we think you'll find it fair."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 7, "Circumstances have changed, {them}, and the Federation must act in its own interests. We trust you understand."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 8, "{them}, that was a mistake. The Federation is reviewing its options, and every one of them involves our fleet."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 0, "We... have slept long, {them}. Waking, we choose trade, not war. Take this... and let us both stand free."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 0, "Small things... given, and taken. So peace grows. Slowly. As it should."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 0, "Hear us. No chains in this bargain... only fair weight, on both sides."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 1, "Old friend... you let us be, and you let others be. That is rare. Take this... freely given."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 2, "We are slow to wake... and slower to forget. Agree, and the sleep stays deep. Refuse... and the giants rise."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 3, "The Council... decides who stays free. Give your votes with ours... so that no people kneels."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 4, "Mm... yes. It is fair."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 4, "Agreed... Peace holds. A little longer."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 5, "No... This would bind someone. We do not bind."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 5, "Hmm... too heavy. We refuse."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 6, "Not so... Shift the weight. Like this. Then it is fair... and we agree."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 7, "It grieves us, {them}... You stood in the way of our freedom. The sleepers wake now... for you."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 8, "You broke faith, {them}... The giants were sleeping. Not anymore."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 0, "Sit down, {them}, sit. The family has a little proposition for you. Strictly between us, of course."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 0, "I like you, so I'm gonna make this easy. You take this, and the Syndicate owes you a favour."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 0, "Nobody needs to hear about this deal. That's what makes it such a good one."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 1, "You're practically family now. And the family takes care of its own - here, this is for you."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 2, "Nice fleet you got there. Be a real shame if something happened to it. So - do we have a deal?"},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 3, "The Council's got a vote coming. Vote the way the family likes, and your little secrets stay buried."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 4, "Good. Very good. You made the smart choice - I knew you would."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 4, "We have an understanding, then. Nobody talks, everybody's happy."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 5, "No. You come to me with this? That's disrespectful, my friend."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 5, "I'm gonna pretend I never heard that offer. For your sake."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 6, "Let me fix this for you. The family's terms are right here - and they're very reasonable."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 7, "Nothing personal, {them} - it's just business. You should have known the family always comes first."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 8, "You crossed the family, {them}. That's the one thing you never do. We'll be in touch."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 0, "Your account is looking thin, {them}. Here's an arrangement to help - at very reasonable interest."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 0, "Everyone owes the Vaden something sooner or later. Why not start now, on favourable terms?"},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 0, "Consider this an investment in you. Of course, the clans always collect on their investments."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 1, "One of our best customers! For you, the clans will waive a little interest. A little."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 2, "Your debt is overdue. Settle on these terms, or we send the collectors - and they bring warships."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 3, "Votes are a currency too, and you're short on every other kind. Vote with us and we'll adjust the ledger."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 4, "Wonderful. It's entered in the ledger - and the ledger never forgets."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. Pleasure doing business. Your next payment is due shortly."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 5, "No. That offer wouldn't cover the interest on what you already owe us."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 5, "The clans don't lend against such poor security. Declined."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 6, "This barely covers the fees. Here are the clans' terms - do read the small print carefully."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 7, "Your credit has run out, {them}. The clans are calling in everything - starting now."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 8, "Default, {them}? Oh, you'll pay for this. Principal, interest and penalties. In full."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 0, "We have your scent, {them}. Trade with us now, while it is still a trade and not a hunt."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 0, "A good hunter knows when to feed and when to wait. Today, the Scourge offers to wait."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 0, "Take this deal. It is the one door we have left open - and we never leave doors open for long."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 1, "You run with the pack, not ahead of it. Take this - the Scourge shares its kills with friends."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 2, "Do as we say. Or run, if you like - we enjoy that part, and nothing ever outruns us."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 3, "Vote with us in the Council, and the hunt passes over you this season."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. You chose not to run. Wise prey live longer."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 4, "Agreed. The hunt can wait - this time."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 5, "No. We would rather take it the old way, after the chase."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 5, "Refused. Prey does not set the terms."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 6, "You bargain like prey begging for its life. Here are the hunter's terms."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 7, "There is nowhere to run, {them}. The truce was only us circling closer."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 8, "You struck and fled, {them}? Run, then. We will be there when you stop."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 0, "Great news, {them}! The Sovereignty sees real synergy between us. Let's talk partnership."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 0, "Our analysts ran the numbers, and this arrangement is a win-win. Ready to sign?"},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 0, "We're expanding into your market, and we'd love to have you on board. Here's our opening proposal."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 1, "You've been an outstanding partner this quarter. Please accept this as a token of our appreciation."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 2, "We can do this as a merger or as a hostile takeover. Accept the terms - you'll prefer the merger."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 3, "The Council is just a board meeting with bigger fleets. Vote with us and we'll make it worth your while."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 4, "Excellent! Welcome aboard. Our people will be in touch with your people."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 4, "Deal closed. The shareholders will be delighted."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 5, "We'll have to pass. The numbers simply don't work for the Sovereignty."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 5, "Thanks, but no. That proposal isn't aligned with our growth strategy."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 6, "Love the energy, but the terms need restructuring. Here's our revised offer."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 7, "We're restructuring, {them}, and your position has been eliminated. Effective immediately."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 8, "Breach of contract, {them}. Our legal department will be in touch - and it flies dreadnoughts."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 0, "The Winnu offer terms - not as beggars, but as the rightful masters of Mecatol Rex."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 0, "{them}, the age of the Lazax is dead, and good riddance. Deal with the Winnu, who will lead what comes next."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 0, "We were ruled once, and we will never kneel again. These terms are offered as equals - for now."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 1, "You have respected the Winnu's claim. Such loyalty will be remembered when the throne is ours. Take these terms."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 2, "Withdraw. No one will stand between the Winnu and the Council again - not the Lazax, and certainly not you."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 3, "By right, the Council belongs to the Winnu. Give us your votes and stand on the right side of history."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. The Winnu remember those who helped us rise."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 4, "Good. Another step toward the throne that is ours."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 5, "No. The Winnu bowed to masters once. We will not bow to your terms."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 5, "Refused. You speak to us as the Lazax did, and look how they ended."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 6, "Your offer smells of the old empire. Here are terms fit for the true heirs of the Council."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 7, "Thrones demand sacrifices, {them}. Today, that sacrifice is you."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 8, "{them}, you treat us as the Lazax did. They are dust now. Remember that."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 0, "Hmm... let us not hurry. The Kingdom offers a fair agreement, and fair agreements last."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 0, "{them}, peace is built one small bargain at a time. Here is ours. Consider it slowly."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 0, "The Xxcha prefer words to weapons. These terms are our words - gentle, and sincere."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 1, "Old friend, you have been patient with us. The Kingdom returns the kindness. Take these terms."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 2, "We ask you, calmly, to withdraw. Our guns are very patient too, and they are always watching."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 3, "Wars are best prevented in the Council. Stand with the Kingdom on this vote, and spare us all a great deal of trouble."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 4, "Mmm. Good. A peaceful bargain is the best kind. Accepted."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 4, "Agreed. May this be the first of many quiet understandings."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 5, "No, we think not. Take your time, and bring us something wiser."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 5, "Regrettably, we must refuse - politely, but completely."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 6, "Close, but rushed. We have smoothed the rough edges. These terms, perhaps?"},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 7, "This grieves us deeply, {them}. But the Kingdom must outlast every friendship, even yours."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 8, "{them}, we offered you peace, and you chose otherwise. Our shell is thick, and our guns are many."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 0, "Brother, the Brotherhood offers you a place among the faithful. This deal is only the first step."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 0, "{them}, you are lost, but you need not stay lost. Accept these terms, and walk with us."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 0, "We are one mind in many bodies. Join the cause, and this bargain becomes a gift of devotion."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 1, "You have heard the call, and the Brotherhood welcomes you. These terms are offered as to one of our own."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 2, "Withdraw, or be shown the true path. All who resist the cause are eventually... converted."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 3, "The faith must have a voice in the Council. Give it yours, and be counted among the righteous."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 4, "Rejoice! You have taken a step toward the light. Accepted."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 4, "It is done. The Brotherhood embraces you, as it embraces all who obey."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 5, "No. Such terms serve only the self, and the self is a lie."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 5, "Refused, seeker. Pray on it, and return when you are ready to give more."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 6, "Your offer is unworthy of the faith. Here are terms that will purify it."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 7, "Never were you truly one of us, {them}. The Brotherhood casts you out."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 8, "{them}, you have turned from the path. We are many, we are one, and we are coming for you."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 0, "Psst. A deal, off the record. No one else needs to know - and no one will."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 0, "{them}, the Tribes hear many things. Take this deal, and some of them stay unheard."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 0, "We have a job for you, and profit for us both. Quietly, of course. Always quietly."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 1, "You have kept our secrets, so we keep yours. Honest terms, from the shadows to a friend."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 2, "Your fleets sleep in such predictable places. Take these terms and move along, and they keep sleeping."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 3, "Every vote in the Council has a price, and we always know it. Sell yours to the Tribes, discreetly."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 4, "Done. This conversation never happened."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 4, "Agreed. A pleasure doing business in the dark."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 5, "No. We have seen your hand, and this deal is not worth the risk."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 5, "Pass. The Tribes smell a trap, and we do not walk into traps - we set them."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 6, "Interesting... but we read the fine print you hid. Here are our terms, nothing hidden. Mostly."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 7, "Thought you knew our game, {them}? You never even saw the board. Goodbye."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 8, "{them}, sloppy work. We were watching the whole time, and now we know exactly where to strike."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 0, "The faithful of Rhodun extend a hand, {them}. Take it, and walk closer to the true knowledge."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 0, "Knowledge belongs to the worthy. Prove your worth: accept this, and be counted among them."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 0, "Our scripture teaches that honest trade purifies both parties. Let us be purified together."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 1, "You have shown reverence, friend, where others showed none. Accept this blessing from Rhodun."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 2, "Your machines grow proud, and pride is heresy. Submit to our terms, or we will humble them."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 3, "The Council strays from the true path. Vote with the faithful and help us lead it back."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 4, "It is righteous. Rhodun accepts, and the archives record your devotion."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 4, "Blessed be this pact. Go, and keep faith with what you have sworn."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 5, "Heresy! We will not barter sacred things for so profane an offer."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 5, "No. The faithful do not bow to offers like this one."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 6, "Your offer is flawed, as all unguided work is flawed. Here it is, corrected by the faith."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 7, "Your knowledge was never yours, {them}. Rhodun has come to take it back."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 8, "Faithless {them}! Your betrayal is written in the archives - and the faithful will answer it."},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 0, "grrrkkkhrrgh... [Trade with the stone, {them}. Stone is honest. Stone is heavy.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 0, "krrrghhkkk... rrgh... [We offer. You take. Simple, like a falling rock.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 0, "hrrrkkgrrrhh... [This deal is solid. Solid like us. Accept.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 1, "rrrhhgrrmm... [You stand firm, friend. The Purifiers do not crush what stands firm.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 2, "KRRRGHHKKKRRR... [Leave as we ask. Or we fall on you from the sky.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 3, "grrhkk... rrrrgh... [Votes. Ours and yours, together. The Council will feel our weight.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 4, "rrghrghkkk... [Acceptable. It is set in stone.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 4, "hhrrrmmkkk... [Good. We crush nothing today.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 5, "KRRKKK... grrhh... [No. This offer is gravel.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 5, "rrrrgggghhh... [Refused. Rock does not bend.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 6, "grrkkhrrghk... [Wrong shape. Here. We chip it into a better one.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 7, "KHRRRGGHHKKK... [Nothing personal, {them}. Your world simply needs purifying.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 8, "RRRGGHHHKKKRRR!... [You crack the stone, {them}? Then the stone falls on you.]"},
    {"mahact", "nivyn", 3, "Star Kings. You claim the spaces between the stars? We ruled the stars themselves. Your votes on this agenda, little king - and perhaps you keep your throne."},
    {"muaat", "bastion", 7, "Your walls held through a hundred wars, Bastion. Let's see how they hold when they're molten."},
    {"bastion", "muaat", 8, "Muaat fire inbound! Seal the bulkheads, all hands to stations! We've outlived worse than a tantrum!"},
    {"letnev", "sol", 0, "The Federation, still playing at empire? The Barony offers terms. Do try to read them before your committees vote."},
    {"letnev", "sol", 7, "Did you truly believe the Barony forgave Sol, {them}? We merely waited for the right moment."},
    {"sol", "letnev", 0, "Barony. The Federation remembers every border you've crossed. Still, we're willing to talk - read these terms carefully."},
    {"sol", "letnev", 8, "{them}, the Federation expected nothing less from the Barony. Our fleets were never stood down."},
    {"hacan", "mentak", 0, "Mentak. Here is a deal - signed, sealed, and NOT an invitation to raid our caravans afterwards."},
    {"hacan", "mentak", 8, "A pirate's word, worth exactly what we paid for it. The Emirates will be pricing your head, {them}."},
    {"mentak", "hacan", 0, "Hacan! My favourite customers. Pay the Coalition's toll today and your caravans sleep soundly tonight."},
    {"keleres", "mentak", 0, "Keleres to Mentak. We know your record. Clean deal, clean conscience - first time for everything, over."},
    {"keleres", "mentak", 2, "Mentak vessels, this is Keleres command. You are out of compliance. Accept these terms or be boarded."},
    {"mentak", "keleres", 0, "Well, if it isn't the space police. Here's a deal, officers. Totally legal. Probably."},
    {"keleres", "tnelis", 0, "Keleres to the Syndicate. We're watching every ledger you own. Here's a legitimate deal - try one for a change."},
    {"tnelis", "keleres", 0, "Officers, please, sit. The family always cooperates with the law. A little something for the precinct."},
    {"keleres", "florzen", 0, "Keleres to Florzen vessels. This is a lawful offer. Take it before we take your ships, over."},
    {"florzen", "mentak", 0, "Mentak! Fellow pirates! Let's not bleed each other - there's loot enough out there for both of us."},
    {"mentak", "florzen", 0, "The Florzen. Pirates without manners. Here's a deal - and keep your raiders out of our lanes."},
    {"mahact", "l1z1x", 0, "Machines wearing the Lazax name. Your masters stole our thrones, and you inherited their debts. Pay them."},
    {"mahact", "winnu", 0, "Winnu. You crave the throne of Mecatol? We sat upon it before your kind could crawl. Take our terms."},
    {"l1z1x", "mahact", 0, "Mahact remnant. The Lazax overthrew you once. This offer is mercy. Comply, and remain overthrown quietly."},
    {"l1z1x", "winnu", 0, "Winnu servant. The Lazax have returned. Kneel, as your ancestors knelt, and submit your tribute."},
    {"winnu", "l1z1x", 0, "Machines wearing a dead empire's name. The Winnu need no Lazax ghosts - but we will take your trade."},
    {"winnu", "l1z1x", 8, "{them}, you are what is left of our old masters - and now we know what it is worth. Nothing."},
    {"mahact", "edyn", 0, "Little Mandate. You wear our crowns and preach mercy. Bargain with your elders, and remember who made you."},
    {"edyn", "mahact", 0, "We remember what you were, Mahact. We chose to be better. These terms are fair - more than you ever offered anyone."},
    {"nivyn", "mahact", 0, "Mahact. You ruled the stars once. We rule the dark between them still. Let kings deal as kings."},
    {"jolnar", "deepwrought", 0, "Cousins! Still giving your discoveries away for free? Charming. Here is a transaction, as civilised minds conduct them."},
    {"jolnar", "deepwrought", 7, "Sentiment is not a variable, {them}. Our shared ancestry was never part of the model."},
    {"deepwrought", "jolnar", 0, "Dearest cousins! We found a little something for you on the sea floor. Please, no charge - well, almost none."},
    {"deepwrought", "jolnar", 8, "{them}... our own cousins. We shared everything with you. The data is conclusive, and it is heartbreaking."},
    {"crimson", "ghost", 0, "...Creuss. Still whole. Still hoarding the light. Give us a little of it... you owe us that much."},
    {"crimson", "ghost", 7, "...you never shared, {them}. So now we take. All of it."},
    {"ghost", "crimson", 0, "...the broken ones return. We offer this... and nothing more. Do not reach for the rest."},
    {"ghost", "crimson", 8, "...we knew, {them}. We always knew what you would become. The gates are closed to you."},
    {"kyro", "yin", 0, "Brothers of the greyfire! We too carry a blessed sickness. Kin in suffering should trade as kin."},
    {"yin", "kyro", 0, "Plague-bearers. The greyfire is a holy trial, not a toy. Still, the Brotherhood will hear your offer."},
    {"ralnel", "hacan", 0, "Hacan. You run the markets, we run the routes. Partners? Quick answer, please - the market moves."},
    {"hacan", "ralnel", 0, "Ral Nel! Swift couriers and sharp ledgers - the Emirates admire both. Come, let us make the markets sing."},
    {"vaden", "hacan", 0, "Emirates. Your caravans already run on Vaden credit, whether you know it or not. Let's make it official."},
    {"hacan", "vaden", 0, "Vaden! You lend at rates that would shame a pirate. Still, the Emirates can bargain with bankers. Here."},
    {"axis", "nokar", 0, "The Sellships! Competitors, yes, but such good customers. Our hulls, your crews - think of the profit."},
    {"nokar", "axis", 0, "Shipwrights. You build them, we fly them into the fire. Let's split the money and both get rich."},
    {"freesystems", "letnev", 0, "Barony. Your people deserve to be free, but for now we deal with their masters. Fair terms - not tribute."},
    {"letnev", "freesystems", 0, "The Compact - all those little worlds pretending to be nations. Adorable. Here are your terms."},
    {"arborec", "muaat", 0, "Muaat. You burn. We grow. These terms keep your fire away from The Green. That is all we require."},
    {"muaat", "arborec", 2, "Arborec, you are made of kindling. Accept our terms, and your forests stay green another day."},
    {"khrask", "muaat", 0, "Children of fire... you burn what took ages to grow. Take this... and let one forest live."},
    {"firmament", "cabal", 0, "Devourer. The Five shelter this galaxy from things like you. Still... even you may be offered peace."},
    {"cabal", "firmament", 0, "Guardians... so many worlds sheltered beneath your wings, like a table laid for us. Shall we talk?"},
    {"kolume", "nekro", 0, "Machine to machine... this one sees in you a mind that knows only endings. Even so, this one offers peace."},
    {"nekro", "kolume", 0, "Meditation | Irrelevant"},
    {"rohdhna", "l1z1x", 0, "Fabrication Code 3-3L classifies your hardware as obsolete, L1Z1X. Upgrades are available. Terms attached."},
    {"augers", "nomad", 0, "Nomad. We have seen the future you are running from. Accept this, and it arrives a little later."},
    {"nomad", "augers", 0, "Seers. You watch the future; I fight it. Help me, and there will be a future left to watch."},
    {"jolnar", "nekro", 5, "Absolutely not. Every agreement with the Virus ends with our research inside your hull. The Universities decline, emphatically."},
    {"jolnar", "nekro", 2, "We have catalogued every flaw in your code, Nekro. Withdraw from our space, or we test them all at once - with our weapons."},
    {"jolnar", "nekro", 8, "{them}, you have stolen our work again. Let the record show: the Universities never forget a plagiarist."},
    {"nekro", "jolnar", 0, "Knowledge | Required"},
    {"nekro", "jolnar", 2, "Data | Surrender"},
    {"nekro", "jolnar", 5, "Library | Inadequate"},
    {"nekro", "jolnar", 7, "Research | Assimilated"},
    {"winnu", "keleres", 0, "The Council's hounds come to bargain? The throne will be ours, Keleres. Until then, these terms will do."},
    {"winnu", "keleres", 5, "You enforce the Council's will - and the Council will be ours. Why bargain with our future servants?"},
    {"winnu", "keleres", 8, "So the Council's police show their true master, {them}. When the Winnu take the throne, your badges go first."},
    {"keleres", "winnu", 0, "Keleres to Winnu. Nobody sits the throne without the Council's say-so. Meanwhile, here's a lawful deal, over."},
    {"keleres", "winnu", 2, "Winnu fleet, you are nearing Council space without clearance. Accept these terms or be escorted out."},
    {"keleres", "winnu", 7, "Dispatch to {them}: your claim to the throne has been reviewed and denied. Agreement void. Keleres out."},
    {"sardakk", "yssaril", 0, "Yssaril hide. Always hide. Sardakk not hide. Take deal. Then come out and fight."},
    {"sardakk", "yssaril", 5, "No deal with shadows. Shadows bite in back. Sardakk bite in FRONT."},
    {"sardakk", "yssaril", 8, "{them}! Coward knife! Swarm finds you in dark. Swarm always finds."},
    {"yssaril", "sardakk", 0, "We hear your swarm long before we see it, Sardakk. Loud things make poor secrets. A quiet deal, then?"},
    {"yssaril", "sardakk", 5, "The N'orr want a deal? We've heard how your last partner ended up. We'll stay in the shadows, thank you."},
    {"yssaril", "sardakk", 7, "All that noise, {them}, and you never heard us coming. Nothing personal - you were just very easy."},
    {"argent", "vaylerian", 0, "Scourge. Two hunters, one sky. The Flight proposes a boundary - your prey on your side, ours on ours."},
    {"argent", "vaylerian", 2, "You stalk the Flight's skies, Scourge. Withdraw, or learn what it is to be the hunted."},
    {"argent", "vaylerian", 8, "{them}. A hunter who turns on a hunter - the Flight will make a trophy of your banner."},
    {"vaylerian", "argent", 0, "Birds that hunt. How quaint. The Scourge will share the hunting grounds - for a price."},
    {"vaylerian", "argent", 7, "Every hunter becomes prey in the end, {them}. Today it is the Flight's turn."},
    {"naalu", "mortheus", 0, "Ssso, the Glimmer drifts into our minds uninvited. We see through your riddles, little nebula. Here are plain terms - for once."},
    {"naalu", "mortheus", 5, "We have read your thoughts, Glimmer, and they are mossstly fog. No."},
    {"mortheus", "naalu", 0, "Two mirrors facing, Naalu - each sees the other seeing. Shall we stop staring and trade?"},
    {"mortheus", "naalu", 8, "You read every mind but your own, {them}. The light remembers what you did."},
    {"kjalengard", "sardakk", 0, "SARDAKK! The only warriors worth a saga besides ourselves! A deal today, and a glorious battle tomorrow!"},
    {"kjalengard", "sardakk", 8, "{them}, oath-breaker! Even a bug knows what an oath is! The skalds will sing of your shame!"},
    {"sardakk", "kjalengard", 0, "Berserkers loud. Sardakk louder. Make deal. Then see who strongest."},
    {"sardakk", "kjalengard", 2, "Berserkers want war? Good. Swarm want war more. Take deal, or war now."},
    {"kjalengard", "ghemina", 0, "Raiders! You sing the old songs badly, but you do sing them. Drink to this deal with us!"},
    {"kjalengard", "ghemina", 5, "The Berserkers do not bargain with raiders who share their spoils with no one!"},
    {"ghemina", "kjalengard", 0, "Berserkers! Your sagas are long and your fleets are small... || Accept, before we shorten both."},
    {"ghemina", "kjalengard", 7, "The Lord has decided your saga ends here, {them}... || Badly."},
    {"naaz", "bentor", 0, "Bentor! You lot keep beating us to the good dig sites. Fine - the Alliance proposes splitting the claims, fair and square."},
    {"naaz", "bentor", 5, "Not this time, Bentor. Last claim we split, the Alliance got the rocks and you got everything worth having."},
    {"bentor", "naaz", 0, "Naaz-Rokha! Our favourite competitors. A joint venture, shares split evenly - well, mostly evenly."},
    {"bentor", "naaz", 7, "Strictly business, {them}. The board voted to dissolve the partnership. The claim is ours now."},
    {"kollecc", "bentor", 0, "Bentor. You dig such lovely things out of the dirt... and then sell them to the wrong people. Sell to us instead."},
    {"bentor", "kollecc", 0, "Kollecc! The only buyers who appreciate a good find. Name your price - and remember who dug it up first."},
    {"zealots", "jolnar", 0, "The Universities play with sacred knowledge like children with fire. Still, the Rhodun will trade - and pray for you."},
    {"zealots", "jolnar", 2, "Your laboratories reek of heresy, Jol-Nar. Accept these terms, or the inquisition visits your worlds."},
    {"zealots", "jolnar", 7, "The trial is over, {them}. Your knowledge was weighed and found blasphemous."},
    {"jolnar", "zealots", 0, "The Rhodun, still burning books? Here is a proposal written in small words, for your convenience."},
    {"jolnar", "zealots", 8, "Predictably irrational, {them}. Faith is a poor substitute for peer review."},
    {"lizho", "yssaril", 0, "Ah, Yssaril. One shadow to another - shall we pretend to trust each other? It's so much more fun."},
    {"lizho", "yssaril", 8, "Oh, well played, {them}! We truly didn't see that one coming. We will be sure to return the favour."},
    {"yssaril", "lizho", 0, "Li-Zho. Smiles in front, knives behind. We know the game - we wrote half of it. A deal, then."},
    {"yssaril", "lizho", 5, "We've heard what happens to the Li-Zho's partners. Mostly from the partners. No."},
    {"hacan", "veldyr", 0, "Veldyr! Executives, the Emirates hear. We were trading before you had a boardroom. Let us show you how it is done."},
    {"hacan", "veldyr", 5, "Your \"partnership\" means we do the work and you buy us out. The Emirates decline."},
    {"veldyr", "hacan", 0, "Hacan! Legacy brand, solid caravans, huge synergy potential. Let's talk partnership - and, later, acquisition."},
    {"veldyr", "hacan", 7, "Nothing personal, {them}. The board approved a hostile takeover of your trade lanes."},
    {"l1z1x", "sol", 0, "Federation of Sol. Your committees, your votes, your elections - all inefficient. The Lazax offer terms. Comply."},
    {"l1z1x", "sol", 2, "Human worlds will be catalogued. Accept these terms and the cataloguing will be gentle."},
    {"sol", "l1z1x", 0, "Mindnet. The Federation doesn't recognise your claim to the Lazax name - but we'll still talk. Carefully."},
    {"sol", "l1z1x", 8, "The Federation was ready for this, {them}. Every fleet, every world. You picked the wrong humans."},
    {"hacan", "xxcha", 1, "Xxcha, old friends! Peace is the best market there is, and nobody keeps it better. A generous deal, for you."},
    {"hacan", "xxcha", 4, "Of course! When the Kingdom proposes, the Emirates know it is fair. Done!"},
    {"xxcha", "hacan", 1, "Hacan... peace and trade grow from... the same root. The Kingdom offers... the gentlest of terms."},
    {"xxcha", "hacan", 8, "We trusted you... as we trust the tide, {them}. The tide... does not do this."},
    {"arborec", "khrask", 1, "Stone that thinks. We have grown around your roots for a long time, Khrask. We offer. ...shhhrrr..."},
    {"arborec", "khrask", 4, "The Green agrees with the stone. It is done."},
    {"khrask", "arborec", 1, "Green ones... you guard... the living worlds. As do we. Take... what you need."},
    {"khrask", "arborec", 8, "Even... the forest... can rot, {them}. We... will remember this... for an age."},
    {"sol", "freesystems", 1, "Free Systems - the Federation's door is always open to free peoples. A fair deal, from one democracy to another."},
    {"sol", "freesystems", 4, "Gladly. Free worlds standing together - the Federation couldn't ask for more."},
    {"freesystems", "sol", 1, "Comrades of Sol! Free peoples must stick together. The Free Systems offer this in solidarity."},
    {"freesystems", "sol", 8, "{them}, we thought Sol stood for freedom. It seems Sol stands for Sol."},
    {"saar", "dihmohn", 1, "Fellow wanderers. The void is wide enough for all of us. Take what helps your flotilla - we ask little in return."},
    {"saar", "dihmohn", 4, "Of course, friends. Travellers should look after each other."},
    {"dihmohn", "saar", 1, "Saar... we have watched your factories drift past our flotilla... always kindly. A gift, then... for the road."},
    {"firmament", "kolume", 1, "Monks of Kolume, the Firmament honours your stillness. We offer this in fellowship - may it bring you peace."},
    {"kolume", "firmament", 1, "The Firmament watches over the many. We watch over ourselves. Perhaps it is the same work. Take this."},
    {"kolume", "firmament", 8, "Even guardians fall, {them}. We will meditate on why you chose to."},
    {"keleres", "kortali", 1, "Keleres to the Tribunal. Always good working with the courts. Clean deal, by the book, over."},
    {"keleres", "kortali", 4, "Copy that, Tribunal. Terms received, terms accepted. Keleres out."},
    {"kortali", "keleres", 1, "The Tribunal recognises the Keleres as officers of order. This offer is entered into the record in good faith."},
    {"kortali", "keleres", 8, "The Tribunal finds {them} guilty of betraying the law itself. Sentence will be carried out."},
    {"naaz", "ralnel", 1, "Ral Nel! You move things, we build things - perfect match. The Alliance's best terms for our favourite haulers."},
    {"naaz", "ralnel", 4, "Deal! Load it up - the Alliance has a machine just waiting for it."},
    {"ralnel", "naaz", 1, "Naaz-Rokha. Reliable. Rare. Good deal, quick terms, no tricks - exit plan not even needed. Almost."},
    {"celdauri", "hacan", 1, "Hacan, our docks are always open to your caravans. A generous deal between honest merchants."},
    {"celdauri", "hacan", 4, "A pleasure, Hacan. Your ships are welcome in our ports any time."},
    {"hacan", "celdauri", 1, "Celdauri! Fine ports, finer merchants. The Emirates offer terms worthy of friends."},
    {"edyn", "xxcha", 1, "Kingdom of Xxcha, the Edyn decree you a friend of the law. Accept this gift as a token of lasting peace."},
    {"xxcha", "edyn", 1, "Edyn... your laws are gentle... and so are ours. Let us... keep the peace together."},
    {"olradin", "freesystems", 1, "Free Systems! The committee voted - unanimously, for once! - to offer you the best deal we have."},
    {"olradin", "freesystems", 4, "All in favour? The People say yes, the Economy says yes, the Environment didn't object. Done!"},
    {"freesystems", "olradin", 1, "Olradin - free peoples deciding things together, just as it should be. Take this deal, comrades."},
    {"nomad", "titans", 1, "Titans. In every future I have seen, the worst one comes while you sleep. Stay awake - I bring help."},
    {"titans", "nomad", 1, "Wanderer... you... have seen... what comes. We... will stand... with you."},
    {"titans", "nomad", 8, "We woke... to protect... every people, {them}. Even... you. No longer."},
    {"kyro", "mykomentori", 1, "Blessed Myko! Your spores and our sacred plague - cousins in the great blooming! A gift for you!"},
    {"mykomentori", "kyro", 1, "The threads say... you and we... feed the same soil, Kyro. Take this... and let it rot well."},
    {"tnelis", "vaden", 0, "The Vaden. The family remembers every interest payment. Here's a deal - and this time, no fine print."},
    {"tnelis", "vaden", 7, "The family has decided your account is closed, {them}. Permanently. Nothing personal."},
    {"vaden", "tnelis", 0, "Syndicate. Your family still owes the clans. We accept this deal as a partial payment - with interest."},
    {"vaden", "tnelis", 8, "The clans will collect, {them}. They always collect. With penalties."},
    {"celdauri", "florzen", 5, "Florzen. We remember what your raiders did to our docks. Our guns remember too. No deal."},
    {"celdauri", "florzen", 2, "Florzen ships, our harbours are armed and our patience is not. Accept these terms or keep your distance."},
    {"florzen", "celdauri", 0, "Celdauri! Lovely ports. Lovely, FULL ports. Pay up and we'll keep them that way!"},
    {"florzen", "celdauri", 7, "Your docks were too full, {them}. We helped ourselves."},
    {"zealots", "rohdhna", 0, "Roh'Dhna. Your machines are an abomination and your manuals blasphemy. And yet the Rhodun will trade. Repent later."},
    {"rohdhna", "zealots", 0, "Doctrine 12-7Z: heresy labels issued by the Rhodun are not legally binding. The Roh'Dhna offers standard terms."},
    {"rohdhna", "zealots", 5, "Article 4-88: no transactions with parties who burn our products. Offer declined."},
    {"sardakk", "xxcha", 0, "Old turtles. Swarm remembers you. You remember swarm. Make deal. Stay remembered."},
    {"xxcha", "sardakk", 5, "Sardakk... the last time... your swarm came to talk... it brought claws. The Kingdom... declines."},
    {"l1z1x", "nekro", 0, "A machine plague that calls itself superior. The Lazax will purge your code. Comply first, and the purge is quick."},
    {"nekro", "l1z1x", 5, "Lazax | Obsolete"},
    {"nekro", "l1z1x", 7, "Mindnet | Absorbed"},
    {"winnu", "mahact", 0, "Mahact. You ruled before the Lazax and you fell. We will rule after them, and we will stay. Take these terms while you can."},
    {"cabal", "lanefir", 0, "Mournful Lanefir... we can make you forget everything you have lost. Everything. Come closer, and take our terms."},
    {"lanefir", "cabal", 5, "We have written the last chapters of too many worlds that trusted hungry voices, Cabal. We will not be the next."},
};
